From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iwinfo: mtk: fix scan band/mhz/ht_operation, center_chan1, and resilient pagination

Set band, mhz, and ht_chan_info on MTK scanlist entries so rpcd and LuCI Channel Analysis do not drop scanned APs, implement mtk_get_center_chan1 and band-aware 6 GHz frequency resolution, accept enterprise/SAE/WEP security modes, skip corrupted rows without aborting scans, and handle multi-page BSS table shrinkage cleanly.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff -uN -p -r /tmp/iwinfo-test/orig-tree/iwinfo_mtk.c /tmp/iwinfo-test/src-tree/iwinfo_mtk.c
--- a/iwinfo_mtk.c	2026-11-23 13:30:04.534140740 +0800
+++ b/iwinfo_mtk.c	2026-11-23 13:32:34.888832763 +0800
